## Common pitfalls

| Mistake                                      | Fix                                                     |
| -------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |
| `--testPathPattern` (singular) deprecated    | Use `--testPathPatterns` (plural)                       |
| Regex misses across line wrap                | Use `[\s\S]*?` and insert `\s*` between adjacent tokens |
| Live-render of page that hits `/api/...`     | Static-source scan instead, or mock the SWR / fetch hook |
| Asserting on hex colour values               | Anchor on token names / palette constants in the source |
| Forgetting `aria-label` on `SegmentedTabs`   | Static VT MUST assert `aria-label="..."` is present     |
| One giant regex on the whole component       | Extract the JSX tag with `match(/<X[\s\S]*?\/>/)` first |
| VT case names drift from VT YAML             | Match `case_name` 1:1; CI will read both                |
| Forgetting to update both DC-TM matrices     | Update `DC-TM-001*.md` AND `DC-TM-002*.csv` in same PR  |

---

## Snapshot tests are banned

Snapshot tests rot silently. Use targeted assertions on the specific
invariants that matter (a token, a prop, an aria-label). If you find
yourself writing `expect(component).toMatchSnapshot()`, write a
static-source VT instead.
